# File headers

Every file we create or substantially rewrite must start with author and last-modified metadata.

- Author: Larry Sikes
- Last modified: YYYY-MM-DD (update on each edit)

Forms:

- `.lhs`: `# Author: Larry Sikes` / `# Last modified: YYYY-MM-DD` / `#`
- `.txt` / `.md`: plain `Author:` and `Last modified:` lines at the top
- `.html`: `<!-- Author: Larry Sikes | Last modified: YYYY-MM-DD -->` after `<!DOCTYPE>`
- `.php`: `// Author: Larry Sikes` and `// Last modified: YYYY-MM-DD` after `<?php`
- `.rs`: `// Author: Larry Sikes` and `// Last modified: YYYY-MM-DD` at the top

See `docs/FILE_HEADER.txt`.
